1
00:00:00,143 --> 00:00:04,889
Part 2 mein hum Medoro Distribution ka account banayenge.

2
00:00:04,889 --> 00:00:11,299
Website se 7-day free trial shuru karenge, email verify karenge, aur sign-in,

3
00:00:11,299 --> 00:00:15,379
password recovery aur account security samjhenge.

4
00:00:16,323 --> 00:00:22,383
Sabse pehle official website kholte hain: medoro dot in slash distribution.

5
00:00:22,383 --> 00:00:26,908
Yeh live website hai, aur hum yahan sirf dekh rahe hain,

6
00:00:26,908 --> 00:00:30,383
koi account live server par nahi bana rahe.

7
00:00:31,044 --> 00:00:39,132
Hero section mein saaf likha hai: orders with credit control, batch-wise stock, schemes,

8
00:00:39,132 --> 00:00:43,543
GST invoices, picking, dispatch aur collections.

9
00:00:43,543 --> 00:00:50,528
Neeche likha hai, From ₹2,499 a month, aur trial mein har feature milta hai.

10
00:00:51,186 --> 00:00:59,080
Pricing section mein bhi likha hai: 7 days free, no card, aur plans apne-aap renew nahi hote.

11
00:00:59,080 --> 00:01:03,494
Yani trial ke liye koi payment details nahi chahiye.

12
00:01:04,152 --> 00:01:07,973
Ab Start 7-day free trial par click karte hain.

13
00:01:07,973 --> 00:01:11,226
Yeh distributor sign-up page kholta hai.

14
00:01:11,226 --> 00:01:18,543
Isi software ki ek alag copy hamare demo server par chal rahi hai, alag database ke saath.

15
00:01:18,543 --> 00:01:25,292
Wahan hum fictional data se account banayenge, taaki live system par kuch na badle.

16
00:01:25,954 --> 00:01:30,059
Yeh hai demo server par wahi sign-up page.

17
00:01:30,059 --> 00:01:33,187
Create your distributor account.

18
00:01:33,187 --> 00:01:36,217
Pehla step: apna email daaliye.

19
00:01:36,217 --> 00:01:40,518
Medoro is email par ek 6-digit code bhejega.

20
00:01:41,167 --> 00:01:45,612
Send code dabate hi code email par chala jata hai.

21
00:01:45,612 --> 00:01:48,723
Code 10 minute tak valid rehta hai.

22
00:01:49,392 --> 00:01:54,649
Demo server ka email ek authorised test inbox mein aata hai.

23
00:01:54,649 --> 00:01:57,015
Yeh raha verification code.

24
00:01:57,015 --> 00:02:01,484
Asli account mein yeh aapke apne inbox mein aayega.

25
00:02:02,144 --> 00:02:08,451
Wapas sign-up page par code daalte hain, aur Confirm and continue dabate hain.

26
00:02:08,451 --> 00:02:10,230
Email confirm ho gaya.

27
00:02:10,230 --> 00:02:16,780
Ab business details ka wizard khulta hai, jise hum agle part mein poora bharenge.

28
00:02:17,426 --> 00:02:23,375
Google se sign-up ka option tab dikhta hai jab server par Google sign-in configure ho.

29
00:02:23,375 --> 00:02:29,878
Is demo server par Google configure nahi hai, isliye hum email wala tareeka use kar rahe hain.

30
00:02:31,544 --> 00:02:39,335
Part 3 mein distributor ka business onboarding karenge: business name, GSTIN, drug licence,

31
00:02:39,335 --> 00:02:46,099
address, owner account, godown, backup recovery kit, aur two-step verification.

32
00:02:46,099 --> 00:02:49,780
Phir distribution settings bhi set karenge.

33
00:02:50,729 --> 00:02:58,581
Email confirm hone ke baad wizard ke paanch steps dikhte hain: Your business, Your account,

34
00:02:58,581 --> 00:03:00,911
Godowns, Backups, aur Done.

35
00:03:00,911 --> 00:03:05,053
Pehle step mein business ki details bharte hain.

36
00:03:05,053 --> 00:03:09,109
Business name: Medoro Demo Pharma Distributors.

37
00:03:09,778 --> 00:03:10,611
Ab GSTIN.

38
00:03:10,611 --> 00:03:18,018
Yeh ek fictional demo GSTIN hai jo Jharkhand ke state code 20 se shuru hota hai.

39
00:03:18,018 --> 00:03:22,462
Medoro format aur checksum dono check karta hai.

40
00:03:22,462 --> 00:03:28,110
Phir wholesale drug licence, yani Form 20B aur 21B ka number.

41
00:03:28,770 --> 00:03:34,323
Address mein godown ya office ka poora pata, city aur PIN code.

42
00:03:34,323 --> 00:03:37,849
Business code apne-aap suggest hota hai.

43
00:03:37,849 --> 00:03:39,964
Hum MEDORO-RNC rakhenge.

44
00:03:39,964 --> 00:03:45,782
Isi code se aapki team aur chemists aapka business dhoondhte hain.

45
00:03:46,436 --> 00:03:48,006
Continue dabaiye.

46
00:03:48,006 --> 00:03:50,778
Doosra step hai owner account.

47
00:03:50,778 --> 00:03:54,473
Medoro mein koi default login nahi hota.

48
00:03:54,473 --> 00:04:01,031
Yeh account business ka maalik hai, aur baaki sab users yahi jodta hai.

49
00:04:01,031 --> 00:04:06,112
Naam, mobile number aur ek strong password daalte hain.

50
00:04:06,765 --> 00:04:08,623
Teesra step: godowns.

51
00:04:08,623 --> 00:04:15,083
Stock, orders aur dispatch har godown ke hisaab se alag rakhe jaate hain.

52
00:04:15,083 --> 00:04:19,684
Pehle godown ka naam Medoro Main Godown rakhte hain.

53
00:04:19,684 --> 00:04:23,489
Baaki godowns baad mein bhi jod sakte hain.

54
00:04:24,142 --> 00:04:27,635
Chautha step: backups aur recovery kit.

55
00:04:27,635 --> 00:04:31,396
Is kit mein backup kholne ki key hoti hai.

56
00:04:31,396 --> 00:04:36,949
Download and print dabaiye, aur ise offline surakshit rakhiye.

57
00:04:36,949 --> 00:04:40,890
Bina is kit ke backup restore nahi ho sakta.

58
00:04:41,565 --> 00:04:48,185
Terms aur Privacy Policy accept karke, Create my distributor account dabaate hain.

59
00:04:48,846 --> 00:04:50,573
Account taiyaar hai.

60
00:04:50,573 --> 00:04:57,049
Screen par likha hai: Your 7-day free trial has started with every feature.

61
00:04:57,049 --> 00:04:59,553
Business code MEDORO-RNC hai.

62
00:04:59,553 --> 00:05:04,130
Ab Set up two-step verification par click karte hain.

63
00:05:04,791 --> 00:05:09,908
Owner aur manager ke liye two-step verification zaroori hai.

64
00:05:09,908 --> 00:05:14,513
Google Authenticator jaisi app se QR code scan kariye.

65
00:05:14,513 --> 00:05:19,971
Security ke liye QR code aur key video mein blur kiye gaye hain.

66
00:05:19,971 --> 00:05:23,723
App ka 6-digit code daal kar Verify dabaiye.

67
00:05:24,376 --> 00:05:27,200
Ab 10 recovery codes milte hain.

68
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:31,082
Agar phone kho jaye, toh inhi se login hoga.

69
00:05:31,082 --> 00:05:37,788
Inhe surakshit jagah save kariye, phir checkbox tick karke Continue dabaiye.

70
00:05:38,434 --> 00:05:42,602
Hum seedhe Distributor dashboard par pahunch gaye.

71
00:05:42,602 --> 00:05:46,352
Abhi yeh khali hai, kyunki koi data nahi hai.

72
00:05:46,352 --> 00:05:51,270
Upar business ka naam aur Medoro Main Godown dikh raha hai.

73
00:05:51,926 --> 00:05:55,315
Ab godown ki details poori karte hain.

74
00:05:55,315 --> 00:05:58,526
Godowns and racks mein Edit dabaiye.

75
00:05:58,526 --> 00:06:04,413
Godown ka code, address, GSTIN aur drug licence yahan bharte hain.

76
00:06:04,413 --> 00:06:08,962
Har godown ki invoice series isi code se banti hai.

77
00:06:09,614 --> 00:06:15,149
Settings mein distribution ke business rules hain: invoice par legal name,

78
00:06:15,149 --> 00:06:19,338
chemists ko bheje jaane wale maal ki minimum shelf life,

79
00:06:19,338 --> 00:06:25,845
purchase cover aur safety stock ke din, aur credit rules todne wale orders ke saath kya

80
00:06:25,845 --> 00:06:28,762
ho: hold for approval, ya seedha block.

81
00:06:29,416 --> 00:06:34,962
Financial year Medoro apne-aap date se samajhta hai, April se March.

82
00:06:34,962 --> 00:06:42,793
Invoice, order aur dispatch number har financial year ke hisaab se naye series mein chalte hain.

83
00:06:42,793 --> 00:06:46,382
Iske liye alag setting ki zaroorat nahi hai.

84
00:06:46,382 --> 00:06:50,460
Neeche integrations ka asli status bhi dikhta hai.

85
00:06:51,124 --> 00:06:53,017
Onboarding poora hua.

86
00:06:53,017 --> 00:06:59,328
Agle part mein dashboard ko detail mein samjhenge, demo data ke saath.
